              "title": "Animal abilities",
              "instruction": "A penguin ___ fly, but it ___ swim very well.",
              "options": [
                "can / can't",
                "can't / can",
                "can / can",
                "can't / can't"
              ],
              "answerIndex": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "t2",
              "type": "true-false",
